behind this thing or I should look here because it makes sense in the game.

00:13:32.360 --> 00:13:37.760
Uh, what you're actually doing is you're just, you're almost mindlessly, excuse me.

00:13:37.760 --> 00:13:40.760
You're almost mindlessly just checking everything.

