Sometimes you get chased.

00:32:34.280 --> 00:32:35.340
Sometimes you do the chasing.

00:32:35.340 --> 00:32:40.520
It was I thought, yeah, like you said, it's not not the combat itself that's good, but

00:32:40.520 --> 00:32:44.080
it's what the combat means for like your strategy and the rest of the game.

00:32:44.240 --> 00:32:46.560
And and this is me being a little picky here.

00:32:46.620 --> 00:32:53.360
But in a wishlist scenario, you would hope that if you enter the same room, it almost like

