You got to imagine that it's more likely a technical limitation because to to draw,

00:35:51.080 --> 00:35:57.400
you know, the same two characters that you're controlling as mirror inputs, you know, at

00:35:57.400 --> 00:36:03.760
the same time. So like having four of your total characters of things that aren't like pre render, not

00:36:03.760 --> 00:36:08.580
rendered, but like pre background stuff that's just fixed locations like to actually have input

00:36:08.580 --> 00:36:09.560
command that stuff.

00:36:09.560 --> 00:36:14.040
I feel like if that was the case, it would slow down the game dramatically to have that.

00:36:14.400 --> 00:36:20.640
I don't know. I mean, like when you're in different rooms, there's there's more there.

00:36:20.660 --> 00:36:26.480
