00:36:33.380 --> 00:36:34.920
to take care of.

00:36:34.920 --> 00:36:39.960
So I just I guess I can't really see it being a technical issue, but there would have to

00:36:39.960 --> 00:36:42.680
be a reason. I'm not talking about sprite limit, though, either.

00:36:42.800 --> 00:36:44.640
I'm not talking about like the amount of sprites.

00:36:44.720 --> 00:36:49.480
